IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PAYPROC.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

DATA DIVISION.

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-AMOUNT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TAX           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TOTAL         PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-STATUS        PIC X(20).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PROCESS.

    DISPLAY "ENTER AMOUNT: ".
    ACCEPT WS-AMOUNT.

    PERFORM CALCULATE-TAX.
    PERFORM CALCULATE-TOTAL.
    PERFORM DISPLAY-RESULT.

    STOP RUN.

CALCULATE-TAX.

    COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-AMOUNT * 0.18.

CALCULATE-TOTAL.

    COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-AMOUNT + WS-TAX.

DISPLAY-RESULT.

    DISPLAY "AMOUNT : " WS-AMOUNT.
    DISPLAY "TAX    : " WS-TAX.
    DISPLAY "TOTAL  : " WS-TOTAL.

    MOVE "SUCCESS" TO WS-STATUS.

    DISPLAY "STATUS : " WS-STATUS.
